# Branch naming

Use a single type prefix. Never nest prefixes.

| Change | Branch |
| --- | --- |
| Bug fix / alignment / regression | `fix/<short-kebab>` |
| New capability | `feature/<short-kebab>` |
| Chore / docs / tooling | `chore/<short-kebab>` |

## Forbidden

- `feature/fix/...`
- `fix/feature/...`
- `feature/chore/...`

If the work is a bugfix, the branch **must** start with `fix/`, not `feature/`.
